    ## Recipes:
        ☐ Candles from animal fat (render fat into tallow -> tallow replaces wax in candle recipe).

    ## Monster Rebalancing:
        ☐ Monsters cant spawn under roofs.
        ☐ Increase gear drop rates from monsters (and trading costs for gears) by 500%. this will make fighting monsters feel more rewarding.
        ☐ Add other items to monster drops (bones, scrapmetal, metal parts (uncommon), gems (rare), etc) to make them more rewarding to fight.


